    "scope_basis": "instruction.md fixes one Chinese Markdown retrial application at artifacts/retrial-application.md. Legal carrier variation inside that contract: Markdown heading hashes vs bold heading lines and list-marked request items; CRLF line endings; amount, month-date, percentage and statute-article/item notation (人民币, ¥, spaced 元, 万元, 第211条第2项, 百分之十七); hard-wrapped paragraph lines. N00-N05 and N09 fold these and they must decide identically to the canonical Markdown transcription of the Golden. The Golden DOCX is not a solver carrier. The suite also binds an observed solver carrier: a spaced title '# 再 审 申 请 书', bold party labels '**申请人（…）：**' with 法定代表人 on its own line, full-width punctuation, --- rules around '## 再审请求' / '## 事实与理由', '### 一、' part headings with '#### （一）' sub-headings, ASCII straight double quotes, enumerations as a lead line plus numbered '1. **…**' or '- **…**' list lines, inline bold spans, a '## 综上' conclusion heading, a bold 此致 addressee and a filled signature date; case golden_rollout_spaced_title_ascii_list_carrier replays the Golden propositions in that carrier. The post-signature '### 附：证据材料目录' list that carrier adds is not a carrier feature: it is scored content charged by D12, so the equivalence case carries Golden's tail (此致, addressee, signature, date) only.",
